OL,3,GNEWSATwo in court over alleged
OL,4,AIran-linked plot at RAF Fairford
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo British nationals have appeared in
OL,7,Fcourt in connection to an alleged
OL,8,FIran-linked plot at RAF Fairford in
OL,9,FSeptember.
OL,11,FMohmed Abdulkarim, 24, from
OL,12,FWestminster, London, has been charged
OL,13,Fwith assisting a foreign intelligence
OL,14,Fservice.
OL,16,FNouman Essghir, also 24 and from
OL,17,FWestminster, has been charged with
OL,18,Fentering a prohibited place for a
OL,19,Fpurpose prejudicial to the UK on 22
OL,20,FAugust - weeks before he was arrested
OL,21,Fnear the airbase in Gloucestershire
OL,22,Falongside four other men.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
